    "@es": "Formas de meN-",
    "@en": "Forms of meN-"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Bantu → membantu** usa **mem-**; **tulis → menulis**, **men-**; **sapu → menyapu**, **meny-**. **Gambar → menggambar** conserva la **g** después de **meng-**.",
     "@en": "**Bantu → membantu** uses **mem-**; **tulis → menulis**, **men-**; **sapu → menyapu**, **meny-**. **Gambar → menggambar** conserves the **g** after **meng-**."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Saber hacer",
    "@en": "Know how to do"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Bisa** significa «poder» o «saber hacer» y ya lo conoces. **Bermain** se usa con deportes; **memainkan**, con instrumentos.",
     "@en": "**Bisa** means «poder» or «know how to do» and you know it. **Bermain** is used with sports; **memainkan** is used with instruments."
    }
   ]
